583
00:26:31.650 --> 00:26:32.510
Je l' možeš da probaš?

584
00:26:32.590 --> 00:26:32.910
Hoću.

585
00:26:33.190 --> 00:26:34.190
I onda sednemo.

586
00:26:34.250 --> 00:26:35.210
I tako smo sedeli danima

587
00:26:35.210 --> 00:26:36.130
s ljudima

588
00:26:36.130 --> 00:26:36.970
na Obilićevom vencu,

589
00:26:36.970 --> 00:26:37.970
