606
00:26:54.870 --> 00:26:56.250
je li ovo nešto što bi igrao?

607
00:26:56.630 --> 00:26:57.250
Zašto da?

608
00:26:57.330 --> 00:26:57.690
Zašto ne?

609
00:26:59.010 --> 00:26:59.810
Imamo još

610
00:26:59.810 --> 00:27:00.670
